@dir include/micro-os-plus/diag/trace
@brief Folder with C++ header files for the µOS++ Tracing Infrastructure.

@details
This folder contains the internal headers that declare the full API of
the µOS++ Tracing Infrastructure. 

These headers should not be included by the user; instead, the
public `"micro-os-plus/diag/trace.h"` should be used.

Inline method definitions are kept in the `inlines` sub-folder and
are included automatically by their respective headers.
